### Notification Service API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081
### Note: All endpoints require userId in request attribute (simulated with X-User-Id header)

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@userId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
@notificationId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001

### 1. Get notifications by recipient ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&createAt=2024-01-01T00:00:00&limit=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### 2. Get notifications by recipient ID (without createAt parameter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isDeleted=false&limit=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### 3. Count unread notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/recipient/count-unread
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### 4. Mark all notifications as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### 5. Mark specific notification as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### 6. Soft delete notification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/soft
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### 7. Hard delete notification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/hard
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###
